                  Updraft                   
                                            {0F}{w}

"Shall I lend you a hand?"{w}{p}"Thanks to Ruu and Makakuri helping me out,
I got to see my dear wicked mage,
and my business in this land is mostly finished."{w}{p}"So maybe I can be of some use to you."{w}

"I'm sorry this is the only way we can ask.{w}Will you do this for us?"{w}{p}"We have allowed many Demon Dukes to invade.{w}We want you to defeat every one of them
and bring back proof."{w}{p}"I'm counting on you. With the power that drove back even us Ryug,
defeat the Demon Dukes."{w}{p}"We entrust the fate of the Ryug to you."{w}

"Indeed, my name is Zaalhaut.{w}And what you say is, well, not far off the mark."{w}{p}"Without me, this lot cannot achieve their goal.
Nor can my own wish be fulfilled..."{w}{p}"In any case, you will send this lot
to the Sanctum of Genesis."{w}

"That is none of your concern.{w}Besides, this lot has no path but the Sanctum of Genesis."{w}{p}"Listen well, adventurers."{w}{p}"The Sanctum of Genesis is where Agintaitus and I
once created the Sun Spirit."{w}{p}"Yes, the place where we made Rafa the Sun Spirit."{w}{p}"Back then, Agintaitus and I
were both still far from skilled..."{w}

"With my present power and your help,
we may be able to make Rafa, still incomplete,
into a true Sun Spirit."{w}{p}"If Rafa's power returns, that land will surely be saved too."{w}{p}"Understood, adventurers!?{w}I will be waiting ahead of you at the Sanctum of Genesis. Be sure to come."{w}
